    "task set moved is not a number. Verdicts follow docs/probe-routing.py:",
    "OBEYED, PARAPHRASED, FAILED.",
    "category/difficulty are scoring metadata; kind still drives execution.",
    "Network tasks stay isolated: they are only run with --allow-network."
